    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">野蠻而衰敗的穴蜥人蜷縮在幽暗地域深底的暗處，與它們的鄰居和其他生物處於持續戰爭的狀態。他們用龜裂的顱骨和遺骸標記自己的疆界，或者用血或糞塗畫的象形文字來標記他們的領土。<br />飢不擇食的穴蜥人或許是最遭人厭的類人生物。他們居住於污穢中。其洞窟的牆壁上塗滿污垢、油膩的分泌物以及它們骯髒盛宴的碎片殘渣。<br /></span><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>純樸野獸Simpleminded Brutes。</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">穴蜥人經營着一種簡單的集體文化，且幾乎只跟覓食相關。它們只會簡單的計劃未來數日的安排，然後依靠不斷的掠奪和狩獵來維持生存。它們尋找比自己弱小的智慧生物，然後對其施虐並以此取樂，然後毫無憐憫的將捉到的獵物拖回自己的巢穴中。最大個最堅韌的穴蜥人會引領狩獵，成爲其部族的領袖。然而，該領導者一旦表現出任何弱點或猶豫，其他的個體就會瘋狂地對其施以攻擊並將其喫掉。<br />穴蜥人很少製作物品或建造建築，而只是對掠走獵物的財寶感興趣。它們瞭解金屬武器和護甲的價值，併爲擁有這些物品的權利而互相爭鬥。穴蜥人可能會因一把長劍引起的衝突而令整個部族分崩離析。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>勞格茲德的信徒Devotees of Laogzed。</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">一些穴蜥人敬仰勞格茲德Laogzed，一隻在無底深淵中沉睡，異常肥胖的魔化蟾蜥。勞格茲德對穴蜥人的崇拜只回應予單純的渴望，而它只期望自己的崇拜者都變得跟它自身一樣滿足於飽食、肥胖和倦怠。</span></p><p>The savage, degenerate troglodytes squat in the shallow depths of the Underdark in a constant state of war against their neighbors and one another. They mark the borders of their territories with cracked bones and skulls, or with pictographs painted in blood or dung.</p><p>Perhaps the most loathsome of all humanoids, troglodytes eat anything they can stomach. They dwell in filth. The walls of their cavern homes are smeared with grime, oily secretions, and the debris of their foul feasting.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Simpleminded Brutes\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Simpleminded Brutes.</span> Troglodytes have a simple, communal culture devoted almost entirely to procuring food. Too simple to plan more than a few days into the future, troglodytes rely on constant raids and hunting to survive. They take sadistic pleasure in hunting intelligent creatures weaker than themselves and show no mercy toward those they capture and drag back to their lairs to be devoured. The largest and toughest troglodytes lead the hunt and become the leaders of their tribes. However, if a leader shows any weakness or hesitation, other troglodytes attack and eat it in a frenzy.</p><p>Troglodytes make little and build less, scavenging their possessions from their prey. They understand the value of metal weapons and armor, and fight among one another for the right to have such items. A troglodyte tribe might be torn apart by battles over a single longsword.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Devotees of Laogzed\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Devotees of Laogzed.</span> Some troglodytes venerate Laogzed, a demonic, monstrously fat toad-lizard that slumbers in the Abyss. Laogzed offers the troglodytes nothing in return except aspiration, for it is the dream of his troglodyte worshipers to become as fat, well-fed, and wearily content as he seems to be.</p></div></div><div class=\"rd__b-special rd__b-inset rd__b-inset--readaloud\"><div class=\"rd__quote\"><p class=\"rd__quote-line rd__quote-line--last\"><span style=\"font-family:宋體\"><em>“這裏臭得像獸人纏腰布的。”</em></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 131.35pt;text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-family:宋體\"><em>矮人勘探員，阿拉斯錘套 Arlax Hammermantle的臨終遺言</em></span></p><p class=\"rd__quote-line rd__quote-line--last\">“<em>Smells liek an orc's loincloth in here!</em>”</p><p><span class=\"rd__quote-by\">— Last words of Arlack Hammermantle, dwarf spelunker</span></p></div></div></div>",
        "public": ""
      },
