    {
      "_id": "4ruegQr56HMwZgBO",
      "name": "惡臭Stench",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "290",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">在穴蜥人身邊</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺範圍內開始其自己回合的生物，除穴蜥人外必須成功通過一次</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">DC 12</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">的體質豁免否則將陷入中毒，中毒狀態持續至該生物的下一回合開始。豁免成功的生物將在隨後</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">小時內免疫所有穴蜥人的惡臭。</span></p><p>Any creature other than a troglodyte that starts its turn within 5 feet of the troglodyte must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=12]] saving throw or be &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned] until the start of the creature's next turn. On a successful saving throw, the creature is immune to the stench of all troglodytes for 1 hour.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
